---
workflowId: "{{.projectId}}-ingest"
displayName: "{{.displayName}} ingest run"
description: "Fetch new/changed documentation, then distill it into memory-ready sections."
version: "1.0"
entrypoint: "fetch"
maxStepVisits: 2
maxIterations: 8
maxWallClock: "45m"
cleanup_artifacts:
  - artifacts/out/fetched-docs.md
  - artifacts/out/ingest-summary.md
steps:
  fetch:
    type: "agent"
    role: "fetcher"
    on_success: "distill"
    on_fail: "recover"
    timeout: "25m"
    retry:
      on: ["container_non_zero_exit", "context_timeout"]
      max_attempts: 3
      backoff: "exponential"
      initial_delay: "30s"
  distill:
    type: "agent"
    role: "distiller"
    on_success: "done"
    on_fail: "recover"
    timeout: "10m"
  recover:
    type: "plan"
    role: "lead"
    on_success: "failed"
    on_fail: "failed"
    timeout: "5m"
terminals:
  done:
    status: "COMPLETED"
  failed:
    status: "FAILED"
    message: "Docs ingest run failed"
---

# {{.displayName}} ingest run

Two-step pipeline: fetch the delta from every configured source,
then distill it for project memory. The lead handles recovery
checkpoints so one unreachable doc site doesn't kill the sync.

## Prompts

### fetch

Fetch what is new or changed from every configured documentation
source since the last sync (memory_search first — delta only, per
the fetcher role prompt). Write each new/changed section to
`artifacts/out/fetched-docs.md` under its own source heading.

### distill

Read `artifacts/out/fetched-docs.md` and produce memory-ready
distillations plus `artifacts/out/ingest-summary.md` per the
distiller role prompt. Your response's top-level `message` field
must carry a 2-3 sentence summary of what was synced.
